  "finding": "Original Zero Giga phase1 copies16 palette/color-processing masks80090CD0..80090D0F into writable Zero overlay801EF974..801EF9B3; phase2 restores them. Co-op reinstalls pristine zero_overlay on every private callback and never captures this writable tail. Corrected actual native probe observes initially nonzero masks becoming64 zero bytes after Giga advances tophase4, coincident with composed black images and a drop to16 setup/clear GP0 commands. Zero subsequently reachesphase6 and normalaction2, but masks/black image do not recover. The original immutable overlay tail remainszero. No shared globals are directly restored or forced by the diagnostic.",
  "source_correction": "An earlier handwritten source note misdecoded the table address by0x100 as80090DD0. The separate living-idle diagnostic sampled that unrelated range and correctly found no change. That report remains preserved and is not used to establish backup loss. Actual-table run explicitly records address80090CD0 and original code spans above verify the corrected target. Native function trace was armed but emitted0 entries; no claim of absent execution is made from that observer.",
  "limits": [
    "Local fixedX/P1+Zero/P2 original USA1.1 intro on the exact v24 image; no paired, other-roster, other-host or original-hardware Giga result.",
    "Only earned-weapon prerequisite flags are granted through audited offline mailbox9/original initializer. Actual original R2 triggers the energy spend/action. No direct HP/ammo/selection/action/clear/success writes or source cards.",
    "Every selected GPU frame is retained in full, but samples are not continuous frame coverage or exact CPU/presentation synchronization. A native Giga-only run reproduces without first activating X option.",
    "Table semantics are native palette/color-processing masks, not a GPU ordering/scheduler table. The final branch admitting exactly16 GP0 commands is not separately traced.",
    "Default native recording is intentionally failed by fixture taint, retained with canonical startup/status artifacts, and strictly rejected by ordinary capture and offline replay. No finalized capture/replay admission.",
    "Native fix56b3fc5 retains the64B writable tail separately and includes it in current wire4 snapshots/digest. Both actual-plugin regression variants fail before the fix; four effect/snapshot variants pass afterward and49 Python state tests pass. Full builds/native repair validation are pending; the issue stays open.",
    "R6 rendered selected/spent ammo ownership and R15/F208 Current Data remain unverified; no ledger status is promoted by this diagnostic."
  ],
